cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this archive, please cite both the technical report and the
  archive itself.
title: >-
  ECN-BENCH replication archive: campaign records, simulation transcripts,
  post-campaign experiments and audit trail
abstract: >-
  Frozen observations and offline reanalysis for a retrospective audit of
  LLM probability extraction from multi-agent simulations. Four campaigns
  cover 30 events and three recorded conditions, including a shared reference.
  On 132 matched simulated evidence records, near-uniform counts differ
  between two extraction configurations. Forecasting comparisons remain
  exploratory: evaluator knowledge leakage, imperfect injection controls,
  serving differences and incomplete raw traces limit interpretation.
  The September revision adds no simulation or evaluator calls.
type: dataset
version: "1.2.2"
date-released: 2026-09-08
repository-code: "https://github.com/MinhHixn/ECN-BENCH"

